{"unit_id": "tag:08WK:statement", "translation": "阿贝尔范畴（abelian categories）之间的任意函子（functor）<MATH_0001>，若它是正合（exact）的且把非零（nonzero）对象（objects）送到非零（nonzero）对象（objects），则反映（reflects）单射（injections）与满射（surjections）。具体而言，正合性（exactness）意味着<MATH_0002>保持核（kernels）与余核（cokernels）（比较同调（Homology）第<REF_0001>节）。例如，若<MATH_0003>为忠实平坦（faithfully flat）的环（ring）同态（homomorphism），则<MATH_0004>具有这些性质。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "abelian categories", "target_term": "阿贝尔范畴"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "exact", "target_term": "正合"}, {"source_term": "nonzero", "target_term": "非零"}, {"source_term": "objects", "target_term": "对象"}, {"source_term": "nonzero", "target_term": "非零"}, {"source_term": "objects", "target_term": "对象"}, {"source_term": "reflects", "target_term": "反映"}, {"source_term": "injections", "target_term": "单射"}, {"source_term": "surjections", "target_term": "满射"}, {"source_term": "exactness", "target_term": "正合性"}, {"source_term": "kernels", "target_term": "核"}, {"source_term": "cokernels", "target_term": "余核"}, {"source_term": "Homology", "target_term": "同调"}, {"source_term": "faithfully flat", "target_term": "忠实平坦"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "homomorphism", "target_term": "同态"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "abelian categories", "target_term": "阿贝尔范畴", "context": "正合函子的定义域与值域，词表未批准。"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "两个阿贝尔范畴之间的函子，词表未批准。"}, {"source_term": "exact", "target_term": "正合", "context": "函子的正合性，词表未批准。"}, {"source_term": "nonzero", "target_term": "非零", "context": "非零对象条件，词表未批准。"}, {"source_term": "objects", "target_term": "对象", "context": "阿贝尔范畴中的对象，词表未批准。"}, {"source_term": "reflects", "target_term": "反映", "context": "从像判断原态射性质，词表未批准。"}, {"source_term": "injections", "target_term": "单射", "context": "函子反映的单射，词表未批准。"}, {"source_term": "surjections", "target_term": "满射", "context": "函子反映的满射，词表未批准。"}, {"source_term": "exactness", "